<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Tudor returns seven weeks after starting sertraline, now six weeks at 50 mg. She has had six sessions of interpersonal psychotherapy and has been able, for the first time, to talk about the friend she lost two years ago and her part in the breach between them. Her mood is lighter on most days; she has resumed audiences on most mornings, played music twice, and seen two old friends. She sleeps about five and a half hours. Her new partial denture is to be fitted next week, and she eats more, though still slowly. She has had no side effects, no falls, and no thoughts of death or self-harm. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Medication</td><td>Sertraline 50 mg for six weeks; no side effects</td></tr><tr><td>Psychotherapy</td><td>Six IPT sessions, focused on grief</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About five and a half hours; Insomnia Severity Index 11</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Audiences most mornings; music and friends again</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal thoughts</td></tr><tr><td>PHQ-9</td><td>8, down from 17</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

