  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Low mood, sleeplessness (about four hours a night), poor appetite, and unintended loss of 3.5 kg (6 percent) over three months, after bereavements and in a demanding public role; under evaluation for depression and medical causes</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
